# Free key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Accepts a comma-separated list. Free-tier quota is counted per key per model, so a second key
# doubles the daily budget; one key is the normal case.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Provider is pluggable; only app/agent/providers/ knows the difference.
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini          # gemini | anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=           # only needed when LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic

# LLM_MODEL is also a preference list. Gemini's free tier allows roughly 20 requests/day per model
# and one multi-step answer spends 3-6, so the agent falls through to the next model (and then the
# next key) once a pair's daily quota is spent. Default:
# LLM_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash,gemini-3.5-flash-lite,gemini-3.1-flash-lite,gemini-3-flash-preview
